Project Directories
To keep the codebase clean, the tools are integrated into these core folders:

src/components: UI elements and ReactFlow/tldraw surfaces.

src/lib/agents: Prompt logic and debate engine.

src/lib/diagrams: Logic for converting text/sketches into visual nodes.

src/lib/scenarios: Competitive data models (Databricks, Snowflake, etc.).
